 e-mail them to me?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:      Sally, I'm not writing it for you!</br>", "id": 6, "time": "56000", "image": "engenn3le02ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      I know. Let's get together tomorrow.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:      OK. Call you later.</br>", "id": 7, "time": "64000", "image": "engenn3le02ob08re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn3le02ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Sally's Blog: Hobbies</span>", "id": 1, "time": "5000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Paragraph structure</span>", "id": 2, "time": "17000", "image": ""}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What are your hobbies?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "How often do you do them?"}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about hobbies and interests."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write a paragraph."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can make suggestions."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type":