d being healthy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You're physically active. What sports teams are there in the area? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "program "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group of lessons "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  There are also many arts and crafts programs available."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le02ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Hobbies"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to get to know someone, ask about their hobbies and interests. You can use the Simple Present tense to ask and answer these questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Questions you can ask: </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "What do you like doing?<br/> What sort of hobbies do you have? <br/>What do you get up to in your free time?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">How to reply: </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In my free time I \u2026<br/> When I have some spare time I \u2026<br/> When I get the time, I \u2026<br/> I relax by (watching TV)."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Interview a friend or family member about their hobbies."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph about their hobbies."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include an opening sentence, 4 body sentences and a concluding sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Review your writing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share with your friend or family member."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I interview a friend or family member."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of hobbies."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph about hobbies."}]}], "type": "sena"}